@mkini_bm Bab doa jumaat ni sapa yg semak dan luluskan teks khutbah..? 
Bkn ke ada majlis agama mufti.. 
Klu gtu doakan je utk semua rakyat negeri..

@wilsonyimby "...has a 66-year-old written rulebook for almost every scenario, including this one."
Yes, on paper. But rules are enforced by people, and people are flawed, easily corrupted and take sides for their own benefit.
How well the rules work depends also on who enforces it.
